<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-18T06:09:44.180Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:09:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian drones struck a Komala base in Erbil province and an explosion hit the outskirts of Erbil, targeting Iranian Kurdish opposition groups. A blast injured five at a Popular Mobilization Forces ammunition depot in Iraq, and a scrap collector was shot dead near a PMF site in Baghdad. Turkish foreign minister praised Iraqi premier's vision for bilateral ties in Baghdad. The conflict has seen continued attacks on Iranian-linked opposition and PMF facilities, while diplomatic engagement persists, with 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/the-bundestag-has-debated-the-genocide-germany-carried-out-in-namibia-a-century-ago-but-will-it-spur-progress-on-addressing-colonial-crimes/a-79682388&quot;&gt;dw.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://freerepublic.com/tag/*/index?more=4399568&quot;&gt;freerepublic.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://redstate.com/bobhoge/2026/10/17/mikie-sherrills-upset-about-planned-ft-hood-terrorist-execution-but-her-reason-is-bananas-n2208281&quot;&gt;redstate.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vice.com/en/article/why-this-75000-year-old-stabbing-victim-is-changing-how-we-see-neanderthals/&quot;&gt;vice.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.jpost.com/middle-east/iran-news/article-911995&quot;&gt;jpost.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPWFdUbERWcFVWeE8wd2N0czh3ZzlaRS1IWHh0ekpZRUcxTDBWYmp6aUZDelhhZjhLMjhrWVpOZmVDUGtyVGhDcFo0WXJFb2Q1TlJkanNfRGpkUFVrSnVfV2FZV0d1Qm1QOGdYVVJNYU16RjA2UGoyWk9iNS1wSzlTQU9hWHQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mehr News Agency&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOVGlTZnJKSU82ejdWaXVGaWI3V3d4bDlaS2hBWWJIUk43SnBmNkZ4